{
    "note": "grok 端到端演示剧本：前三条是 run_terminal_command 工具调用，让 grok 连续跑三轮工具循环（真实执行 ls / echo / pwd）；最后一条是纯文本，grok 收到就收工并把这句话打印出来。所以本剧本要配 --exhausted hold 用：即使意料之外地多来一次请求，拿到的也是同一条收尾文本。压测请用 scripts/grok-scenario.json + --exhausted loop。工具名与形状按 grok 0.2.120 实测：名字是全称 run_terminal_command，required = [\"command\", \"description\"]（description 必填）。",
    "defaults": {
        "delayMs": 10,
        "chunkDelayMs": 1,
        "chunkSize": 4
    },
    "responses": [
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "先看一眼当前目录里有什么。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_grok_ls",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "run_terminal_command",
                            "arguments": { "command": "ls", "description": "列出当前目录内容" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "再打印一行标记，确认工具链路是通的。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_grok_echo",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "run_terminal_command",
                            "arguments": { "command": "echo llm-mock-perf-tick", "description": "打印压测标记" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "接下来确认工作目录的绝对路径。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_grok_pwd",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "run_terminal_command",
                            "arguments": { "command": "pwd", "description": "打印工作目录绝对路径" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "三轮工具调用都回来了：目录列表、标记回显与工作目录路径都正常，llm-mock 的 OpenAI Chat Completions 链路验证结束。"
            },
            "finish_reason": "stop"
        }
    ]
}
